{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1520792-how-compatible-are-nwod-merits-with-chronicles","id":1520792,"title":"How Compatible are nWoD Merits with Chronicles?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-16T16:33:28-07:00","id":1520792,"title":"How Compatible are nWoD Merits with Chronicles?","content":"Long story short I\u2019ve been trying to compile a list of additional Merits for my players \u2014 anything that\u2019s not in the core 2e book but thematically fitting basically. So far I\u2019ve taken some from HtV 2e &amp; Hurt Locker.<br /> <br /> I started to add some of the Slasher merits to this list but I realized it\u2019s under the nWoD umbrella. Which got me second guessing whether or not they work with Chronicles rules. Anybody able to shed some light on this please?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27935-trynmybest","name":"trynmybest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27935_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-16T18:59:03-07:00","id":1520794,"title":"","content":"A lot of first edition merits got upgraded either in official products or in third party products by the authors who write the books. Some upgraded merits read very similarly to the originals while sometimes the original merits make little to no sense without an understanding of first edition rules and books. And sometimes things were changed for balance. All of which is to say it's going to be on a case by case basis. <br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bThat said, there are a lot of merits in CofD without needing to go back to first edition and you want to be careful and not cause decision paralysis with your players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-16T19:41:04-07:00","id":1520795,"title":"","content":"I get what you\u2019re saying abt merits being upgraded for 2e but I wasn\u2019t asking about first ed merits in general. I\u2019m really only interested in a couple merits from Slasher, Asylum &amp; Midnight Roads.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27935-trynmybest","name":"trynmybest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27935_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-17T01:56:49-07:00","id":1520797,"title":"","content":"It depends on what systems they interact with. There are systems that passed over into second edition entirely unchanged and systems that got rebalanced or significantly rewritten.<br /> <br /> For example, Defense still calculates the lesser of Dexterity and Wits (though it now adds Athletics) and dice modifiers still work the same, so Atavism still works. Killing blows still work the same, so Murder Expert still works (but may be unbalanced to give normal access to as a Merit - in the same way it was in first edition). But derangements are gone, Morality (now Integrity) works differently, and weapon ratings have different effects, so any Merits interacting with those would need to be rewritten or dropped. (The simple rule of thumb for converting 1e weapon bonuses into 2e weapon ratings is just to subtract one, as I recall.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-17T16:24:00-07:00","id":1520843,"title":"","content":"That clears things up a bit thnx","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27935-trynmybest","name":"trynmybest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27935_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}